        "caption": "With the port of Dover in the background, Class 375 \"Electrostar\" EMUs operated by SouthEastern are seen approaching Shakespeare Tunnel on the line between Dover Priory and Folkestone. Photo was taken from the footpath which runs along the cliff tops. The path in fact is part of the North Downs Way which starts in Farnham in Surrey and finishes in Dover. Photo taken on 29 July 2008.",
